	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AP_FVDOFTPJEdU5Ke",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 14, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 14, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 8, DODGE 10, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AoqT4mQfSBire1Ozl",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 31 (offense 18, protection 13), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "ATuczqB8DT37mhuxK",
			"text": "Howl of Despair: The barghest may take a Ready maneuver to emit a howl. Any creature that hears it must roll a Fright Check using the Despair table at -2 (Pyramid #3-92, p. 29). If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this ability for one hour."
		},
		{
